,\n    "secondary": "#23232a",\n    "accent": "#e50914"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a dark background with red accent elements. The main area displays a grid of movie cards, each showing the poster, title, year, and action buttons (Add to Watchlist, Showtimes). A loading spinner appears during data fetches. An offline message overlays the content if the user is offline. The layout adapts to mobile and desktop screens, maintaining a clean, modern look."\n}'}",
